NAME
    commands - List the installed command packages.

SYNOPSIS
    commands | ?

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    Enumerate the .CMD package descriptors currently installed in /System/Commands. The shell has no built-in command availability list.

FILE AND DIRECTORY NAVIGATION
    dir [path]
    cd <folder> | cd .. | cd \
    tree [path]

FILE AND FOLDER MANAGEMENT
    mkdir <folder>
    rmdir <folder>
    copy <source> <destination>
    move <source> <destination>
    del <file> [file ...]
    ren <old> <new>
    type <file>

SYSTEM AND SERVICE COMMANDS
    capabilities, info, uptime, cpu, memory, drivers, devices
    filesystem, networking, network, storage, graphics, display
    audio, input, time, power, timers, font, buffering, keyboard
    clear, echo

KERNEL ADMINISTRATION
    interrupts, scheduler, smp, syscalls, processes

HELP
    help <command>
    man <command>

FILES
    /System/Commands/CMDS.CMD
    /INU/HELP/CMDS.MAN
